      "content": "self-kindness doesnt really change the fact that i'm just a drain on my family. my mom is constantly tired because she's looking after me, and my friends barely text back anymore. it just feels like the most selfless thing would be to stop being a problem for them. like, if i wasn't here, they could finally just breathe again, you know?",
